          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"31121513-7af2-4c56-9add-d6348bb53635\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/31121513-7af2-4c56-9add-d6348bb53635\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> <var data-math-identifier=\"AC\">AC</var>  =  <var data-math-identifier=\"BC\">BC</var>  =  4, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> равен 30°. Най­ди­те вы­со­ту <var data-math-identifier=\"AH\">AH</var>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">2</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><p>По­сле­до­ва­тель­но по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"AH=AC\\sin \\angle C=4\\sin 30^{\\circ}=4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2\"></span>.</p></center></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Альтернативное решение.\"><p>Тре­уголь­ник <var data-math-identifier=\"AHC\">AHC</var>  — пря­мо­уголь­ный, от­ре­зок <var data-math-identifier=\"AC\">AC</var>  — ги­по­те­ну­за, от­ре­зок <var data-math-identifier=\"AH\">AH</var>  — катет, ле­жа­щий на­про­тив угла в 30°. Сле­до­ва­тель­но, длина этого ка­те­та вдвое мень­ше длины ги­по­те­ну­зы:  <span data-inline-latex=\"AH=\\frac{AC}{2}=\\frac{4}{2}=2\"></span>. </p></section>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
          "schema_version": 3,
