              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>В прямоугольном <span data-inline-latex=\"\\triangle AHC\"></span> <span data-inline-latex=\"AC\"></span> — гипотенуза. По определению синуса</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin \\angle C=\\frac{AH}{AC}=\\frac{33}{66}=\\frac{1}{2}\"></span>,</p></center><p>откуда, так как угол <span data-inline-latex=\"C\"></span> острый,</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle C=30^{\\circ}\"></span>.</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">30</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            }
